source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A third bracket part is a link title Jira reads separately; JFM has no link title, so jiro keeps it in the target rather than dropping it.
-- input.jira --
[x|http://x|t]
-- rendered.html --
<p><a href="http://x" title="t" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">x</a></p>
-- want.md --
[x](http://x|t)
-- warnings.json --
[]
